# 📝 Real-Life Problems

## Problem 1: Download Two Files Simultaneously

```go
package main

import (
    "fmt"
    "time"
)

func download(file string) {
    fmt.Println("Downloading", file)
}

func main() {

    go download("File1")
    go download("File2")

    time.Sleep(time.Second)
}
```

---

## Problem 2: Process Student Results

```go
package main

import "fmt"

func calculate(ch chan string) {
    ch <- "Result Published"
}

func main() {

    ch := make(chan string)

    go calculate(ch)

    fmt.Println(<-ch)
}
```

