---

## Problem 5: Multiple Workers

```go
package main

import (
    "fmt"
    "time"
)

func worker(id int) {
    fmt.Println("Worker", id, "Started")
}

func main() {

    for i := 1; i <= 3; i++ {
        go worker(i)
    }

    time.Sleep(time.Second)
}
```

