# 📊 Goroutine vs Thread

| Goroutine             | Thread            |
| --------------------- | ----------------- |
| Lightweight           | Heavyweight       |
| Managed by Go Runtime | Managed by OS     |
| Low Memory Usage      | High Memory Usage |
| Faster                | Slower            |

